\f0\b\fs36 \cf0 Purpose\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f1\b0\fs24 \cf0 This audit reviews the current Clarity Caddy codebase against the intended production-exposure boundary:\

\f0\b Internal development/admin systems can remain rich and descriptive. The production player surface should receive only the minimum information required to run the product.
\f1\b0 \
The objective is not cosmetic obfuscation. It is to reduce unnecessary exposure of:\
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\partightenfactor0
