internal algorithm terminology;\
\ls1\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
resolver and mapper diagnostics;\
\ls1\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
confidence values;\
\ls1\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
worker stages;\
\ls1\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
implementation/version provenance;\
\ls1\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
provider/source details;\
\ls1\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
internal asset structure;\
\ls1\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
raw backend errors;\
\ls1\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
development and Studio tooling.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0
\cf0 The preferred architecture is:\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0

\f2\fs26 \cf0 Rich internal records\
        \uc0\u8595 \
Explicit publish / delivery boundary\
        \uc0\u8595 \
Allowlisted player contract\
        \uc0\u8595 \
Clarity Caddy runtime\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f1\fs24 \cf0 rather than attempting to remove sensitive fields individually after constructing a large internal response.\
\
\uc0\u11835 \
