\pard\pardeftab720\sa321\partightenfactor0

\f0\b\fs48 \cf0 Executive Summary\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f1\b0\fs24 \cf0 The codebase is already moving strongly in the right direction, particularly for the native Clarity Caddy application.\
The existing App / Studio split removes a substantial amount of authoring, administration and diagnostic code from the native application build. The Course Package API also already acts as a useful server-side delivery boundary instead of making the phone directly consume complete internal database records.\
However, the production boundary is not yet complete.\
The highest-priority findings are:\
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\partightenfactor0
\ls2\ilvl0
\f0\b \cf0 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 {\listtext	1	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
Studio/internal JavaScript remains publicly retrievable from the Netlify production deployment.
\f1\b0 \
\ls2\ilvl0
\f0\b \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 {\listtext	2	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
Player course packages still expose resolver confidence, geometry/mapper versions and worker state.
\f1\b0 \
\ls2\ilvl0
\f0\b \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 {\listtext	3	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
Raw mapper failure strings can cross directly into player-facing API responses.
\f1\b0 \
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\partightenfactor0
\ls2\ilvl0
\f3\b\fs26 \cf0 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 {\listtext	4	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
playSurface
\f0\fs24  is passed through as an object rather than being explicitly field-allowlisted.
\f1\b0 \
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\partightenfactor0
\ls2\ilvl0
\f0\b \cf0 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 {\listtext	5	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
Visual asset URLs still reveal internal 
\f3\fs26 captures/frames/...
\f0\fs24  storage structure.
\f1\b0 \
\ls2\ilvl0
\f0\b \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 {\listtext	6	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
Several APIs can return raw backend 
\f3\fs26 details
\f0\fs24  to clients.
\f1\b0 \
\ls2\ilvl0
\f0\b \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 {\listtext	7	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
The unauthenticated client-error intake deserves additional abuse and privacy hardening.
\f1\b0 \
\ls2\ilvl0
\f0\b \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 {\listtext	8	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
Production browser globals and diagnostic naming remain descriptive, although this is lower priority than the structural issues above.
\f1\b0 \
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0
\cf0 No obvious hard-coded Supabase service-role key, Stripe secret or equivalent production credential was found in the current source reviewed.\
No obvious production source-map publishing configuration was found.\
