\f0\b\fs48 \cf0 7. Full Course Package Sanitisation\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f1\b0\fs24 \cf0 The Full Course Package already does something important correctly:\

\f0\b it reconstructs a player-specific package instead of returning the complete internal visual record.
