\uc0\u11835 \
\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa1286\partightenfactor0

\f0\b\fs192 \cf0 8.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa643\partightenfactor0

\f3\fs104 \cf0 playSurface
\f0\fs96 \
\pard\pardeftab720\sa321\partightenfactor0

\fs48 \cf0 Pass-Through\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f1\b0\fs24 \cf0 One area within the Full Course Package deserves further tightening.\
Currently the visual worker\'92s:\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0

\f2\fs26 \cf0 metadata.playSurface\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f1\fs24 \cf0 object is effectively passed through to the player.\
