\f2\fs26 \cf0 projection\
anchorPins\
sourceBounds\
captureZoom\
originPx\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f1\fs24 \cf0 Some or all of these may genuinely be required.\
The architectural problem is that the 
\f0\b object itself
\f1\b0  is trusted.\
If a worker later adds:\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0

\f2\fs26 \cf0 sourceProvider\
recipe\
debugTransform\
captureMethod\
workerVersion\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f1\fs24 \cf0 those fields could begin reaching production automatically.\
